Godot ignores this directory entirely: nothing under docs/ is scanned, imported or exported.

docs/ holds documentation and the LOCAL design-reference libraries under docs/design_refs/
(reference-only material, never production assets). Without this file Godot imported the
Aetheria xianxia moodboards into .godot/imported/ like any game texture - listed in the
FileSystem dock, draggable into a scene, and included by an "export all resources" build.
"Gitignored" is not "out of res://" (D-057, L-044). The file's CONTENT is ignored by Godot;
only its presence matters.
